        "kind": "teach",
        "title": "Say it is time for an expected action",
        "blocks": [
          {
            "text": "该 + action + 了 says an action is now due or appropriate. It does not report that the action has already happened.",
            "examples": [
              {
                "text": "该吃饭了。",
                "pinyin": "gāi chī fàn le 。",
                "meaning": "It is time to eat.",
                "audio": "36670d18430d508fdf19a8ffe9941fe54db08192a0a519ea7ab14c92f5d4b377"
              },
              {
                "text": "该回家了。",
                "pinyin": "gāi huí jiā le 。",
                "meaning": "It is time to go home.",
